{"title":"빙고","artist":"거북이","sourceId":"reference:mALtVrCwmsDudsP8B4yf","sourceHash":"c93e0908375992d5a3de752016e7d8a7d1ce8cb9ca5608adcddb1dcf34c07b0a","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":37288028,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":5.16,"end":8.16,"text":"Ladies and gentlemen, 아싸, 또 왔다, 나 (아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":8.16,"end":10.05,"text":"아싸, 또 왔다, 나","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":10.05,"end":11.51,"text":"기분 좋아서, 나","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":11.51,"end":13.58,"text":"노래 한 곡 하고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":13.58,"end":14.91,"text":"하나, 둘, 셋, 넷","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":14.91,"end":18.72,"text":"터질 것만 같은 행복한 기분으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":18.72,"end":22.05,"text":"틀에 박힌 관념 다 버리고, 이제 또","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":22.05,"end":25.44,"text":"맨주먹 정신 다시 또 시작하면","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":25.44,"end":29.41,"text":"나 이루리라, 다, 나 바라는 대로 (hey)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":29.41,"end":32.86,"text":"지금 내가 있는 이 땅이 너무 좋아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":32.86,"end":36.58,"text":"이민 따위 생각한 적도 없었고요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":36.58,"end":39.83,"text":"금 같은 시간 아끼고 또 아끼며","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":39.83,"end":43.97,"text":"나 비상하리라, 나 바라는 대로 (빙고)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":43.97,"end":47.05,"text":"산속에도 저 바닷속에도 (아싸, 아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":47.05,"end":51.09,"text":"이렇게 행복할 순 없을 거야, 랄랄랄라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":51.09,"end":54.02,"text":"구름 타고 세상을 날아도 (아싸, 아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":54.02,"end":57.77,"text":"지금처럼 좋을 수는 없을 거야, 울랄랄라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":57.77,"end":61.08,"text":"모든 게 마음먹기 달렸어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":61.08,"end":65.15,"text":"어떤 게 행복한 삶인가요? (아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":65.15,"end":68.37,"text":"사는 게 힘이 들다 하지만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":68.37,"end":71.91,"text":"쉽게만 살아가면 재미없어, 빙고 (빙고)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":71.91,"end":75.48,"text":"거룩한 인생 고귀한 삶을 살며","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":75.48,"end":79.03,"text":"부끄럼 없는 투명한 마음으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":79.03,"end":82.7,"text":"이내 삶이 끝날 그 마지막 순간에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":82.7,"end":89.37,"text":"나 웃어 보리라, 나 바라는 대로 (빙고)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":89.37,"end":93.06,"text":"(Hey)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":93.06,"end":93.42,"text":"(아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":93.42,"end":95.3,"text":"아싸, 또 왔다, 나","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":95.3,"end":97.16,"text":"기분 좋아서, 나","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":97.16,"end":98.50999999999999,"text":"노래 한 곡 하고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":98.50999999999999,"end":100.47,"text":"하나, 둘, 셋, 넷","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":100.47,"end":102.00999999999999,"text":"한 치 앞도 모르는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":102.00999999999999,"end":104.16,"text":"또 앞만 보고 달리는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":104.16,"end":105.68,"text":"이 쉴 새 없는 인생은","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":105.68,"end":107.8,"text":"언제나 젊을 수 없음을 (haha)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":107.8,"end":109.37,"text":"알면서도 하루하루 지나가고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":109.37,"end":111.2,"text":"또 느끼면서 매일매일 미뤄 가고 (yeah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":111.2,"end":113.14,"text":"평소 해 보고 싶은, 가 보고 싶은 곳에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":113.14,"end":114.82,"text":"단 한 번도 못 가는 이 청춘 (빙고)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":114.82,"end":118.02000000000001,"text":"산속에도 저 바닷속에도 (아싸, 아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":118.02000000000001,"end":121.98,"text":"이렇게 행복할 순 없을 거야, 랄랄랄라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":121.98,"end":125.31,"text":"구름 타고 세상을 날아도 (아싸, 아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":125.31,"end":129.16,"text":"지금처럼 좋을 수는 없을 거야, 울랄랄라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":129.16,"end":132.45,"text":"모든 게 마음먹기 달렸어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":132.45,"end":136.15,"text":"어떤 게 행복한 삶인가요? (아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":136.15,"end":139.45,"text":"사는 게 힘이 들다 하지만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":139.45,"end":143.29,"text":"쉽게만 살아가면 재미없어, 빙고 (빙고)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":143.29,"end":146.53,"text":"피할 수 없다면 즐겨 봐요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":146.53,"end":150.52,"text":"힘들다 불평하지만 말고 (아싸)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":150.52,"end":153.82999999999998,"text":"사는 게 고생이라 하지만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":153.82999999999998,"end":157.38,"text":"쉽게만 살아가면 재미없어, 빙고 (빙고)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":157.38,"end":160.93,"text":"거룩한 인생 고귀한 삶을 살며","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":160.93,"end":164.4,"text":"부끄럼 없는 투명한 마음으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":164.4,"end":168.02,"text":"이내 삶이 끝날 그 마지막 순간에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":168.02,"end":174.94,"text":"나 웃어 보리라, 나 바라는 대로 (빙고)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":174.94,"end":178.28,"text":"(Hey)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":178.28,"end":179.28,"text":"(아싸)","translation":"",